    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SafetyOFF Simulator</strong> is a physics-based simulation game about building, constructing and riding water slides.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign Mode</strong> contains one hundred levels where you will have to demonstrate your engineering skills and knowledge of physics. Don't harm your testers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your engineering creativity in  <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong>.</p>",
